(NoDoom core: the map, the screen and the player, shared by every NoDoom file.)
include nocalc's math

Create an array named wad_map with 256 slots
Create an array named screen with 800 slots

Let a number be called player_x
Let a number be called player_y
Let a number be called player_angle
Let a number be called move_dir
Let a number be called rot_dir
Let a number be called ray_col
